      "tips": "Demonstrate a structured quantitative framework like RICE or Kano, tie directly to company OKRs, and emphasize customer value.",
      "model_answer": "I use the RICE scoring framework (Reach, Impact, Confidence, and Effort) aligned with company strategic OKRs. I calculate reach across active cohorts, gauge quantitative impact on key metrics, evaluate confidence through user research signals, and divide by engineering sprints. High-leverage quick wins are prioritized for early MVPs, and regular stakeholder alignment reviews ensure the team remains focused on customer retention and core value propositions rather than loud opinions."
