      "tips": "Structure metrics into North Star, Adoption/Engagement, Retention, and Guardrail/Counter metrics.",
      "model_answer": "I organize metrics into a four-tier hierarchy: North Star, Adoption, Engagement, and Guardrails. For adoption, I track 7-day and 30-day feature discovery rates and onboarding completion. For engagement, I measure recurring interaction depth and impact on 30-day user retention cohorts. Crucially, I establish guardrail metrics\u2014such as page load latency, support ticket volume, or churn in adjacent flows\u2014to ensure the feature does not cannibalize existing platform health."
